  "sections": [
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "heading": "Histogram",
      "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.znotes.org/cie/igcse/maths-0580/image067.png\"></p><ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>A histogram displays frequency of continuous or grouped discrete data using bars</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Bars are joined together and may be of varying width</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Frequency of the data is represented by the area of the bar and not\nthe height. When class intervals are different, area of the bar represents the frequency, <span class=\"underline\">not the height</span></p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Frequency density plotted on y-axis,\n<span class=\"underline\">not</span> frequency</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p><strong>Class width</strong> = Size of Interval</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p><strong>Frequency density</strong> = Height</p>\n</li>\n</ul><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Frequency = Class\\ width \\times Frequency\\ density</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">re</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.03588em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.03588em;\">cy</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.7778em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.01968em;\">Cl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ss</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02691em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.13889em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">re</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.03588em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.03588em;\">cy</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.03588em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>"
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "heading": "Averages",
      "html": ""
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "heading": "Mean",
      "html": "<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>Sum&nbsp;of&nbsp;values</mtext><mtext>number&nbsp;of&nbsp;values</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\text{Sum of values}}{\\text{number of values}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1.2251em; vertical-align: -0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">number&nbsp;of&nbsp;values</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Sum&nbsp;of&nbsp;values</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong>Estimated Mean (Grouped Data)</strong></p><ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Find the midpoint of each group,</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Multiple each midpoint by its frequency,</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Add the results and divide by the total frequency.,</p>\n</li>\n</ul><p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Estimated&nbsp;Mean</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Midpoint</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>Frequency</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mtext>Total&nbsp;Frequency</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Estimated Mean} = \\frac{\\sum (\\text{Midpoint} \\times \\text{Frequency})}{\\text{Total Frequency}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Estimated&nbsp;Mean</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1.4911em; vertical-align: -0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 1.01em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Total&nbsp;Frequency</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position: relative; top: 0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Midpoint</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Frequency</span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></p>"
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "heading": "Median",
      "html": "<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>The middle value - when the data has been written in ascending\nor descending order</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Odd No. of Values:  (n+1)/2 th value</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Example: For 5 values → (5+1)/2 = 3rd Value</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Even No. of Values:  (n)/2 and (n/2 +1)th values</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Take average of these two values</p>\n</li>\n</ul>"
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "heading": "Mode",
      "html": "<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">Most frequently occurring value</li>\n</ul>"
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "heading": "Range",
      "html": "<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Range = Highest Value - Lowest Value</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Quartiles</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.znotes.org/allimages/acc3acc2b504e89fd3f62d9c.webp\"></p>\n</li>\n</ul><ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">Upper Quartile (Q3) -</li>\n</ul><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n  \\frac{3}{4}(n + 1)\n  </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 2.0074em; vertical-align: -0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span><ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">Lower Quartile (Q1) -</li>\n</ul><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n  \\frac{1}{4}(n + 1)\n  </annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 2.0074em; vertical-align: -0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span><ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">n = total number of data in a set</li>\n</ul><p><strong>Modal Class Interval</strong> - Class interval with the highest frequency</p>"
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "heading": "Understanding Cumulative Frequency",
      "html": "<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Cumulative frequency is the total frequency up to a given point</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Inter-quartile range <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= upper\\ quartile - lower\\ quartile</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02778em;\">er</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.03588em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02691em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02778em;\">er</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.03588em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>Interpreting Cumulative Frequency Diagrams</p>\n</li>\n</ul><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.znotes.org/cie/igcse/maths-0580/image068.png\"></p><ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p>The cumulative frequency graph must always follow a sigmoid curve shape</p>\n</li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<p><strong>Percentiles</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul><p><img alt=\"Percentiles and Quartiles\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Snf6Wpn-L4c/hq720.jpg?sqp=-oaymwE7CK4FEIIDSFryq4qpAy0IARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJD8AEB-AH-CYAC0AWKAgwIABABGGUgZShlMA8=&amp;rs=AOn4CLDeeLgWQTqEVt4Ukn1tBGYjuAU7dg\"></p>"
    },
    {
      "level": "h2",
      "heading": "Pie Charts",
      "html": "<ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<h3>Definition -</h3>\n<p>Sectors represent data, and these sectors form a circle.</p>\n</li>\n</ul><ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">\n<h3>Angle of a sector:</h3>\n</li>\n</ul><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mfrac><mtext>Number&nbsp;of&nbsp;an&nbsp;item</mtext><mtext>Total&nbsp;number&nbsp;of&nbsp;items</mtext></mfrac><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>360</mn><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = \\ \\frac{\\text{Number of an item}}{\\text{Total number of items}}\\  \\times 360^{{^\\circ}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 2.0574em; vertical-align: -0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Total&nbsp;number&nbsp;of&nbsp;items</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top: -3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Number&nbsp;of&nbsp;an&nbsp;item</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.9369em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.9369em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.9369em; margin-right: 0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.5239em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.7485em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.931em; margin-right: 0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.znotes.org/cie/igcse/maths-0580/image071.png\"></p><ul node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding-left: 20px;\">\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">Sum of angles in a pie chart is <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>360</mn><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">360^{{^\\circ}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8869em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.8869em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.8869em; margin-right: 0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.5239em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.7485em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.931em; margin-right: 0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li node=\"[object Object]\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 2px 0px;\">Calculate the angle for each sector representing a category, then use a protractor to draw the sectors within a circle</li>\n</ul>"
    },
    {
      "level": "h3",
      "heading": "Definition -",
      "html": "<p>Sectors represent data, and these sectors form a circle.</p>"
    },
